<SiteLayout title="Privacy policy"><article class="policy-page"><span class="eyebrow">INFORMATION</span><h1>Privacy, with<br /><em>care.</em></h1><p class="setup-hint">Owner/legal review required before publication. This starter text is not legal advice.</p><h2>Information we process</h2><p>If accounts and appointment bookings are enabled, Ocean Valley may process the information necessary to provide those services, such as account details, appointment details and payment references. Payment card details are handled by the payment provider and are not stored by this website.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information should be used only for disclosed purposes such as account access, appointment administration and service communications. Final purposes, lawful basis, retention periods and contact details must be supplied and approved by the owner.</p><h2>Your choices and contact</h2><p>Owner-approved contact and rights-request details must be added before launch. Do not submit sensitive health or payment-card information through this website.</p></article></SiteLayout>
